COMPILATION OF: E48E2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48E2

   1 a 0000 E48E2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2e] store-ladder edge with a NEGATIVE compare
   4 a 0006      constant: c = -2.  The ladder is never witnessed at a negative
   5 a 0006      c on either route ([C143] pins +5, [C324] pins +2/+3). */
   6 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   7 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
   8 c 0006   b = (k = -2);
   9 c 0013   put list('B=', b);
  10 c 0035   stop;
  11 a 0038 end E48E2;

CODE SIZE = 0038
DATA AREA = 0005
FREE SYMS = 38AE
END  COMPILATION
